markdown <<MARKDOWN
#### Let’s hear what Sal and Hadi have to say about how AI is going to impact all of us.

<br>

<details style="background-color: #ececec; padding: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 5px;">
    <summary style="font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: bold;">📝 Key Points from the Video</summary>
<div style="margin-top: 20px; margin-left: 20px; margin-right: 20px; padding-bottom:20px;">
    <p>

* #### AI will significantly impact all industries by increasing productivity, especially in tasks involving writing or any computer-based work.
* #### AI will not replace jobs entirely but will automate repetitive tasks and assist with initial drafts and corrections, making jobs easier and reducing the time needed to complete tasks.
* #### It's crucial for the education system to teach students not only how to use AI but also how it works, its risks, and its strengths and weaknesses, to prepare them for a future workforce that heavily incorporates AI.
* #### Understanding the nature of how AI works and its potential for biases and errors is important for users to recognize its limitations and effectively utilize its capabilities.

</p></div>
</details>
MARKDOWN
